 "title": "HL3416 20 V, 6.5 A N-channel trench MOSFET in SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "A single N-channel enhancement MOSFET in SOT-23, rated 20 V drain to source and 6.5 A continuous at 25 °C ambient. On-resistance is specified down to 1.8 V of gate drive (22 mΩ max at 4.5 V, 26 mΩ at 2.5 V, 48 mΩ at 1.8 V), with a 0.45 to 1.0 V threshold and a ±10 V gate rating. ESD protection is rated 2 kV HBM. Uses listed are battery-powered systems, solid-state relays and direct TTL/CMOS logic-level interfacing.",
